    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3" data-stagger>
      <article class="card"><div class="card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h3>One platform, all the way down</h3><p>HubSpot architecture is the whole business. We are not adding CRM work to a service list that also includes advertising and brand design. When the problem is a broken data model or a routing rule dropping leads, depth is what solves it.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><div class="card-icon card-icon--blue"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h3>Fast, and you can reach us</h3><p>A dedicated implementation team means work moves in days rather than sprint cycles. You talk to the people building your system. We reply within 24 hours on business days.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><div class="card-icon card-icon--green"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-lines" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h3>Everything documented</h3><p>Every build ships with SOPs, data model documentation, automation logic, and a permission matrix. Your team can run, change, and explain the system without us.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

